.","poem":2}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Xoossa Deraa Anjjeteth"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Intteno Yerusalaamen de7iza Xiyoone derezoo! Hayssafe sinththan intte yeekkeketa; intte izakko waassishin izi inttena waani maarennee? Intte waaso izi siyidi inttes eeson zaaro immana."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["GODAY inttes waaye kaththinne meto haath immikokka hayssafe guye intte astamaarey inttefe qotettenna; intte ayfetikka intte astamaareza be7ana."]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["Intte hadirs woykko ushach giikko intte guyera, «Ogezi hayssa; izara biite» gizayssa intte hayththi siyana."]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["Hessafe biran meeshettida intte eeqa xoossatanne worqqan meeshettida misleta intte moorana; «Nuuppe haakkite» giidi tuna carqqa mala intte wora yeggana."]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["Ne zerida kaththas izi ira immana; biittafe mokkida kaththay muurutanne daro gidana. He wode intte mehey aaho demban heemettana."]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["Goshsha booratinne hareti bakkan bukki suragettida harqqonne basso maana."]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["Asay wuriza wolqqama gallassan miixati laalettishin gita zumata ubbata bollafenne zumbullata ubbata bollafe duge haaththi goggana."]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["GODAY meqqida ba deraa koolishin, madunththidayssa paththishin, aginay arshe mala poo7ana. Arshes issi gallassa poo7oykka laappun gallassa poo7o mala gidana."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Asoore Qaxxayeteth"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["Be7ite, GODAA sunththay",{"text":"eexxiza hanqora,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"shaara mala dhippi gida cuwara","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"haakoppe yaana;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"iza metershati hanqon kumida;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"iza inxarsayka","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"xuuggiza tama mala.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{